# .dockerignore — the build context for BOTH images.
#
# ⚠ THE BUILD CONTEXT IS THE REPOSITORY ROOT, not the app directory:
#
#     docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .
#     docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .
#
# Mandatory, because this is a pnpm workspace: `apps/api` depends on
# `@leetcamp/domain` and `@leetcamp/application` with `workspace:*`, and pnpm can
# only resolve that if `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, the root `pnpm-lock.yaml` and
# `packages/*` are inside the container. Building with `apps/api/` as the context
# fails with ERR_PNPM_WORKSPACE_PKG_NOT_FOUND.
#
# ONE file for both images, because Docker resolves `.dockerignore` per CONTEXT,
# not per Dockerfile. What each image does not need is filtered by selective
# `COPY` inside its own Dockerfile.

# ── Dependencies: reinstalled inside the container ──────────────────────────
# Critical, not cosmetic: the development machine is probably macOS/arm64 and the
# images are linux. Carrying node_modules in would ship native binaries for the
# wrong OS (ORM engines, esbuild, fsevents) on top of inflating the context by
# hundreds of megabytes.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ── Build artefacts: regenerated inside the container ───────────────────────
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# The generated ORM client is already git-ignored; the build stage regenerates it.
apps/api/src/generated

# ── Secrets: NEVER in an image ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Real `.env*` files stay out of the context entirely. Configuration arrives via
# `--build-arg` (the public frontend variables) or as runtime environment
# variables (the API). The `.env.example` files DO go in: they are documentation.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── History and tooling the image does not need ─────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
docs

# ── Test artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage
test-results

# ── Infra: the compose file is not copied into the images ───────────────────
deploy

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
